{
	"SchemaName": "NWL_LineLevel",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"_comment": "NorthWest ships line level twice in one workbook: a Webpm sheet and a Daq sheet from two different billing systems. Both sheets carry the same data under different headers, and the exporter merges them into one CSV whose header is the union of both. Each column below therefore lists BOTH spellings - Name is the Webpm header, Aliases carry the Daq equivalent (and any other spelling seen in the wild). Every spelling in one column entry is treated as interchangeable, and each row takes the value from whichever of them its own sheet filled in. To support a renamed column, add the new spelling to that column's Aliases - no code change is needed.",
